# The exclusion list BuildKit actually reads for
#
#     docker build -f cash-sentinel/Dockerfile .
#
# A .dockerignore is resolved against the build *context*, and this image is
# built from the repository root (see the header of Dockerfile). BuildKit looks
# for `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` first, which is this file; cash-sentinel's own
# .dockerignore only applies if someone builds with that directory as context.
# Keep the two in step.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
**/.vite

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github
docs
*.log
.DS_Store
